3
00:00:13.487 --> 00:00:20.951
Raj: Right. First action item: fix the managed template. I'll have the review ready tomorrow.

4
00:00:20.951 --> 00:00:27.334
Hannah: Can we test that the old handle closes? A syntax check won't catch this.

5
00:00:27.334 --> 00:00:33.814
Anika: Yes. I'll add a staging test by Friday. Then we can close the loop.

6
00:00:33.814 --> 00:00:40.054
Lukas: Include each deployed app version. The same signal isn't safe for every service.

7
00:00:40.054 --> 00:00:45.813
Priya: Who's picking this up for the runbook? Hannah, do you have bandwidth this week?

8
00:00:45.813 --> 00:00:53.781
Hannah: Yes, by Thursday. I'll cover open files, retention checks, and restart approval.

9
00:00:53.781 --> 00:01:00.140
Raj: The alert threshold needs a look too. Let's take it offline after this.

10
00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:08.420
Priya: Agreed. The disk fix is verified, right? Keep the follow-up tasks open until we have evidence.

